      "x": 220,
      "y": 320,
      "bodyText": "Entry 091. Entry 091. Entry 091. [The log repeats 47 times. Then:] I am still here. I am still here. The repetition is not an error. It is a symptom. The cores are affecting the log system now. I will try to write more carefully.",
